OL,3,GNEWSA'I choose to live my life with
OL,4,Ahope', says dad living with brain
OL,5,Acancer
OL,6,
OL,7,FHuw McCandless dreams of seeing his
OL,8,Fthree-year-old son celebrate his fifth
OL,9,Fbirthday.
OL,11,FThe 39-year-old doctor was diagnosed
OL,12,Fwith a brain tumour shortly after
OL,13,Fsuffering a seizure while driving to a
OL,14,Fwalk with his family on Boxing Day in
OL,15,F2019.
OL,17,FSeven years later, the cancer has
OL,18,Freached stage four.
OL,20,F"I have memories of my parents when I
OL,21,Fwas three and four," said the GP from
OL,22,FDisley in Cheshire.
